/span></span><br><span><span></span></span><br></div></code></pre></pre>
<p class=3D"g-md-p">5. <code class=3D"g-md-code">cat hello_cli.txt</code> t=
o print the contents of the <code class=3D"g-md-code">hello_cli.txt</code> =
file to the <a target=3D"_blank" href=3D"https://www.AI Academy by RiWoT.com/resourc=
es/docs/command-line/terminal" class=3D"g-md-a gamut-1r92bn9-AnchorBase e14=
vpv2g0">terminal</a>. You should see something like:</p>
<pre class=3D"g-md-pre"><pre class=3D"gamut-mu6hz5 e1rzuoz70"><code><div da=
