/span><span class=3D"mtk4">.</span><span class=3D"mtk1">txt</span></span><b=
r><span><span class=3D"mtk1">Hello Command Line</span></span><br><span><spa=
n></span></span><br></div></code></pre></pre>
<p class=3D"g-md-p">Good job! You=E2=80=99re ready to explore the world of =
the Command Line Interface on your own computer.</p>
